# M9 9.7 gate: F1 opens the DBF-backed help browser (help.dbf fixture),
# typing filters topics case-insensitively, Enter opens the topic body,
# Esc backs out and closes; the Command window then proves the round trip.
key f1
text rep
key enter
key esc
key esc
text ? "help round trip ok"
key enter
eof
